u=note_evidence(63,'43','The printed strategy reads sarvair bhavadbhis taṃ dṛṣṭvā nodanīyo balād aham. The earlier negative gloss, “not to drive him away,” is withdrawn: nodanīya can be a positive gerundive associated with causative nud, whose lexicon senses include urging or impelling, and there is no separately printed na. Exact intended force/action and direction remain unresolved.','NEEDS_REVIEW')
variant('63-strategy','Before: the gods were said to be told not to drive the child away. After: no negative or push direction is asserted; raw nodanīyo clause awaits grammatical/edition collation. This affects the full Analāsura narrative scope.',u)
next(p for p in d['passages']if p['id']=='gup5-p-63-43-51')['extraction_status']='PARTIAL'
